ingFor.\r\n> \r\n> This is indeed the case for most subclasses of `JdbcDatabaseContainer`. And I imagine, depending on the internal image lifecycle, the same issue of wait behavior being independent of init script execution (hence introducing a race condition), could be present for other database container implementations as well.\r\n\r\nI agree it impacts all the subclasses. It is usually not noticeable if the init script is short as well. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/2061979713/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"luanhui0420","id":52189083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTg5MDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52189083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420","html_url":"https://github.com/luanhui0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luanhui0420/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":12512626139,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAgP_mc6F5TrNzwAAAALpz4Xb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/events/12512626139","actor":{"login":"luanhui0420","id":52189083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTg5MDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus